      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} I have only tested this on the current version, however it has been an issue for a few months now. Testing now, the issue seems to have changed. The shader is no longer pink, however the textures are gone. They are displaying as white though lightmaps seem to work again.\n\nI have two worlds affected;\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ad63ee55-4836-4bc6-a3a0-87f6951ebcd6\n\nWithin this one, you must traverse slightly further into the map from spawn to see the issue.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_a02b9986-f676-4d14-a10b-dc8abe59e25f\n\nIn this, pressing the middle button on the wall close to spawn will take you to an environment where the walls have lost their texture.",
